WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:03.753
<i>Hear me out.</i>

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:07.882
<i>Favela city.</i>

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:12.554
<i>We all struggling.</i>

00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:14.764 line:0%
<i>Following our hearts, our dreams.</i>

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:16.307 line:0%
<i>The problem is that to dream
we need to close our eyes.</i>

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:18.226
<i>We ain't got time to spend, bro.</i>

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:19.394
<i>In a second...</i>

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:22.897
<i>your whole life can change.</i>

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:28.194 position:56%
<i>Is that what you want for your life?</i>

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:30.447
<i>Be a buffoon in front of everybody?</i>

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:33.324 position:59%
<i>This will never earn you respect, son.</i>

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:34.868
Respect comes from work.

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:38.997 position:58%
Good morning, my family.
Let's go, our production never stops.

00:00:39.664 --> 00:00:40.790
<i>I came to get the stuff.</i>

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:41.666
-The stuff.
-Yeah.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:42.792
This shit is great.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.085 position:66%
And when are you gonna give me some sugar?

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:45.754
I'm always around.

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:48.298
Only 15 bucks.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.257
<i>It's the cops.</i>

00:00:52.135 --> 00:00:55.680 position:61%
<i>God showed me He has big plans for you.</i>

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.934 position:63%
If you go to jail, we're screwed, Nando.

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:02.353
You are not alone in this one.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.022
<i>Tell them I'm on it.</i>

00:01:04.105 --> 00:01:05.899
I'm gonna show I'm for real.

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:17.243 position:59%
<i>Nobody has the right to judge anybody.</i>

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:18.828
Everybody deserves a second chance.

00:01:19.454 --> 00:01:22.457
<i>If you point the banger,
you gotta make it bang.</i>

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.334
All you brothers here today,
my role models.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:26.628
<i>Because out there
everybody wants to kill us.</i>

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.214 position:61%
<i>And our struggle is against the system.</i>

00:01:31.508 --> 00:01:32.967
We're a family.

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:34.010
The three of us.

